WEBVTT

01:53.480 --> 01:54.800
Thank you this time.

01:59.240 --> 02:00.800
How do you plan to thank me?

02:09.720 --> 02:12.720
Thank you. Let's have dinner together.

02:13.960 --> 02:15.760
Jiang Xizhen invited us to dinner.

02:18.760 --> 02:21.680
You two. I've finally found you.

02:21.760 --> 02:22.840
You two.

02:22.920 --> 02:25.280
You're not young anymore. Stop pretending.

02:25.360 --> 02:27.200
- Run.
- Do you think you can fool me?

02:27.280 --> 02:28.680
Stop. Don't run.

02:28.760 --> 02:29.960
Young man, stop right there.

02:30.040 --> 02:32.080
Hurry up. Both of you, stop.

02:32.160 --> 02:33.200
You're not students.

03:03.080 --> 03:06.080
So, she was chasing after me back then.

03:33.520 --> 03:35.160
FENGRUI BUILDING

03:35.240 --> 03:37.240
- Encircle them. Hurry.
- Stop.

03:38.560 --> 03:39.840
Stop.

03:43.200 --> 03:44.240
You two.

03:45.520 --> 03:47.480
Do you really think
I can't catch up with you?

03:48.000 --> 03:51.400
I've been dealing
with mischievous students for years.

03:51.480 --> 03:53.680
Of course, I can handle you two.

03:55.080 --> 03:56.080
Turn around.

03:56.160 --> 03:57.440
Hurry.

04:03.200 --> 04:05.280
Zhou, what's going on?

04:06.120 --> 04:08.040
They're clearly two students.

04:08.800 --> 04:10.720
They're not pretending.

04:10.800 --> 04:13.480
- You scared them.
- Wasn't it them just now?

04:16.040 --> 04:17.640
I must've chased the wrong ones.

04:19.040 --> 04:20.640
I must be seeing it wrong.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.000
Really.

04:22.079 --> 04:23.080
Why did you two run?

04:23.160 --> 04:24.880
It's about to rain.

04:24.960 --> 04:26.480
In that case, hurry back home.

04:27.080 --> 04:27.920
Go home.

04:31.600 --> 04:32.440
Go then.

04:35.480 --> 04:36.800
What a commotion.

04:38.000 --> 04:41.320
PEPSI

04:47.880 --> 04:48.880
Su Chengcheng,

04:50.280 --> 04:51.720
did you like me in the past?

05:01.080 --> 05:03.720
Yes. I used to like you.

05:04.760 --> 05:06.360
So what?

05:06.440 --> 05:08.560
Who hasn't been immature
when they were young?

05:10.280 --> 05:11.280
I like you too.

05:12.880 --> 05:14.360
You like me?

05:14.440 --> 05:15.680
You don't think I'm ugly anymore?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.160
I think

05:20.800 --> 05:21.880
you're ugly?

05:33.240 --> 05:34.840
Can I take a picture?

05:39.960 --> 05:40.920
You…

05:42.560 --> 05:44.280
Why did you take a picture of me?

05:44.920 --> 05:46.040
You look so bad.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.920
- Wipe it off.
- Sorry.

06:13.400 --> 06:14.960
The photo I took

06:16.040 --> 06:17.360
wasn't about you.

06:18.680 --> 06:22.640
It was because your makeup
wasn't stable and looked bad.

06:24.680 --> 06:27.000
You weren't calling me ugly?

06:27.520 --> 06:30.560
I like Su Miao and Fang Jin,

06:31.560 --> 06:32.920
not because of their appearance

06:35.800 --> 06:38.440
but because they have
your good personality.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.400
You're kind,

06:42.400 --> 06:46.280
cheerful, optimistic, and hardworking.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.480
Enough. Stop saying that.

06:49.000 --> 06:51.040
I'm not as good as you say.

06:52.480 --> 06:54.120
No matter how you change,

06:57.160 --> 06:58.320
my heart

07:00.000 --> 07:02.160
will tell me again and again

07:03.600 --> 07:04.680
that it likes you.

07:08.640 --> 07:10.240
But I was blinded

07:11.880 --> 07:14.000
by appearances again and again,

07:15.080 --> 07:16.280
so I couldn't see the truth.

07:20.760 --> 07:21.720
Sorry.

07:23.960 --> 07:25.360
I've disappointed you.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.320
You…

07:35.360 --> 07:37.320
Can you like me again?

08:00.520 --> 08:02.160
You two. It's you two.

08:04.080 --> 08:05.280
Don't move.

08:05.800 --> 08:08.440
I've got you this time. Listen.

08:10.560 --> 08:12.880
Oh, it's you two.

08:14.480 --> 08:16.160
What's with my eyes today?

08:16.720 --> 08:19.360
Didn't you two go home already?
Why are you still here?

08:20.560 --> 08:21.440
We're leaving soon.

08:21.520 --> 08:23.480
Hurry up and go. It's going to rain.

08:26.720 --> 08:29.240
What's with my eyes today?

08:39.400 --> 08:40.400
Tang Qi.

08:40.919 --> 08:43.240
Don't move. Your face is flickering.

08:58.360 --> 08:59.840
Young people.

10:04.640 --> 10:06.200
They're all me,

10:07.240 --> 10:10.720
but they're me at different ages.

10:11.320 --> 10:13.840
You're still so cute when you're old.

10:14.440 --> 10:15.440
Don't laugh,

10:15.520 --> 10:18.000
or I'll turn you into an old man
when the filter comes back.

10:31.800 --> 10:32.840
Don't be nervous.

10:33.360 --> 10:36.520
Even if they come,
I won't let them see you.

10:40.640 --> 10:42.000
Aren't you afraid of me?

10:44.160 --> 10:45.440
Why would I be afraid?

10:46.240 --> 10:48.200
I'm like a mortal

10:48.280 --> 10:51.000
who suddenly got a treasure
I shouldn't use.

10:51.880 --> 10:54.200
I greedily use it again and again,

10:54.720 --> 10:55.600
and in the end,

10:56.120 --> 10:58.800
I've become a monster that can't be seen.

11:00.280 --> 11:02.640
I've always thought my sister was pretty,

11:03.240 --> 11:05.080
and I wasn't good-looking.

11:06.160 --> 11:10.240
Deep down, I've always been afraid
to face my true self.

11:11.080 --> 11:13.080
I'm not as good as you say.

11:20.360 --> 11:21.880
No one is perfect.

11:26.920 --> 11:28.400
You have your flaws,

11:30.040 --> 11:31.360
and I have mine.

11:32.960 --> 11:37.320
The filter only changes your appearance,
but not your inner self.

11:38.280 --> 11:39.200
What I like

11:42.120 --> 11:43.440
is the imperfect you.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.160
Thank you

11:49.720 --> 11:52.040
for liking the imperfect me.

11:56.080 --> 11:58.080
Who said I liked you?

12:00.800 --> 12:01.880
You did.

12:19.000 --> 12:21.840
I have low EQ, I'm awkward with words,

12:22.680 --> 12:25.040
I'm strict with work, and I'm stubborn.

12:27.640 --> 12:29.280
My colleagues don't want
to be close to me.

12:33.520 --> 12:35.600
I have genetic eye problems.

12:39.800 --> 12:41.160
Would you be willing to like

12:42.880 --> 12:44.480
and accept this version of me?

13:00.480 --> 13:01.520
I would.

13:08.480 --> 13:09.320
Well,

13:10.120 --> 13:13.480
would you be willing to like and accept

13:14.400 --> 13:15.840
this version of me?

13:33.680 --> 13:34.600
I would.

14:10.160 --> 14:15.040
REAR AIR CONDITIONING

14:19.200 --> 14:20.040
It's okay now.

14:22.040 --> 14:24.560
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

14:31.200 --> 14:32.040
UPGRADING

14:35.080 --> 14:36.840
Does the filter have
a virtual control panel?

14:37.480 --> 14:39.360
Whenever I want a certain effect,

14:39.440 --> 14:41.440
I can control it
through the control panel.

14:42.160 --> 14:44.800
Does a thunder mean an upgrade?

14:45.440 --> 14:46.320
No.

14:46.840 --> 14:48.680
The upgrades aren't regular.

14:48.760 --> 14:50.800
They come and leave suddenly.

14:51.400 --> 14:53.680
But whenever there's thunder,
the filter becomes unstable.

14:56.480 --> 14:59.480
Now that there's no thunder,
will your face still change?

15:00.960 --> 15:03.000
It won't change during the upgrade.

15:03.520 --> 15:05.240
It will freeze.

15:05.760 --> 15:08.480
Only when the filter is upgraded
will it return to normal.

15:11.520 --> 15:15.400
No wonder you used to ask
for sick leave and work from home.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.600
Sorry.

15:23.680 --> 15:27.000
It's congested because of the rain.
I'll be about 15 minutes late.

15:27.600 --> 15:29.480
Jiang Xizhen said she'll be a bit late.

15:32.600 --> 15:33.600
How about this?

15:34.120 --> 15:36.800
You go meet her.
I'll wait for you in the car.

15:37.800 --> 15:39.880
This is your first project in charge.

15:42.120 --> 15:45.360
Can I go meet her like this?

15:46.120 --> 15:50.240
We'll go together.
We'll cooperate if there's a problem.

15:53.720 --> 15:54.560
OK.

16:14.000 --> 16:16.880
Then I'll just talk like this.

16:17.800 --> 16:19.000
Wow.

16:19.920 --> 16:21.320
- It sounds like it.
- Really?

16:21.400 --> 16:22.400
You should speak slower.

16:23.160 --> 16:25.080
Just like this.

16:34.800 --> 16:35.800
She's here.

16:37.360 --> 16:39.240
Miss Jiang, please have a seat.

16:40.920 --> 16:43.280
Senior Tang, is this your grandma?

16:43.360 --> 16:44.560
- No.
- Yes.

16:48.080 --> 16:49.280
Sit down.

16:51.360 --> 16:55.400
I'm Su Chengcheng's grandma.

16:56.920 --> 17:00.080
I'm also a loyal fan of your grandma.

17:00.600 --> 17:03.360
Chengcheng had a stomachache,

17:03.440 --> 17:06.640
so I came along just to join the fun.

17:06.720 --> 17:08.720
- Yes, yes.
- You don't mind, do you?

17:08.800 --> 17:11.160
We are just old classmates having a meal,

17:11.240 --> 17:12.599
and you're Su Chengcheng's grandma.

17:12.680 --> 17:14.319
I'm happy to have you here.

17:15.119 --> 17:16.640
What would you like to eat?

17:17.160 --> 17:18.400
Granny, you should order.

17:19.040 --> 17:21.400
It's okay.
I'm old and don't know what to eat.

17:21.480 --> 17:22.920
You go ahead. You should order.

17:26.119 --> 17:30.200
Let's have home-style shrimp
with sweet peas,

17:30.800 --> 17:33.600
stir-fried yam, white-cut chicken,

17:34.560 --> 17:35.560
sauced beef,

17:38.200 --> 17:40.200
and an eight-treasure duck.

17:41.160 --> 17:42.000
Alright.

17:42.840 --> 17:43.760
Please wait a moment.

17:44.400 --> 17:46.720
Also, Sichuan-style mouth-watering chicken

17:46.800 --> 17:48.040
and…

17:49.280 --> 17:50.640
signature dry-braised duck.

17:51.160 --> 17:52.040
OK.

17:53.200 --> 17:54.040
Here you go.

17:54.640 --> 17:55.560
Thank you.

17:56.280 --> 17:57.720
Has Ms. Bai seen the photos?

17:58.240 --> 17:59.400
Granny has seen the photos.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.760
She's really touched,
and she's looked at your proposal.

18:01.840 --> 18:03.160
She finds it quite interesting.

18:03.240 --> 18:06.160
But when it comes to work,
she's very cautious.

18:06.240 --> 18:08.360
She needs your product quality
inspection report.

18:10.240 --> 18:12.000
Here's our CMA inspection report.

18:16.400 --> 18:18.200
INSPECTION REPORT

18:18.280 --> 18:20.480
Sure, I'll pass it on to Granny.

18:20.560 --> 18:22.640
By the way, I tried your perfume,

18:22.720 --> 18:23.800
and I really liked it.

18:23.880 --> 18:27.160
If the product is good,
I'll do my best to persuade Granny.

18:28.280 --> 18:30.080
Thank you.

18:31.440 --> 18:33.880
Granny, you really care
about Chengcheng's career.

18:35.240 --> 18:37.680
I am…

18:37.760 --> 18:40.400
I'm Chengcheng's…

18:41.120 --> 18:41.960
Career fan.

18:42.040 --> 18:43.200
- Yes.
- Career fan?

18:43.280 --> 18:44.120
Yes.

18:44.800 --> 18:46.080
Career fan.

18:56.360 --> 18:58.880
Senior Tang, your taste has changed a lot.

18:58.960 --> 19:01.200
I remember you used
to like eating light food.

19:07.920 --> 19:09.720
Come on. Have some water.

19:11.840 --> 19:13.040
Slow down.

19:16.760 --> 19:18.240
Don't rush.

19:20.080 --> 19:22.200
No, Chengcheng likes it,

19:22.800 --> 19:23.920
so I want to try it.

19:38.440 --> 19:40.320
Granny, can you eat it this spicy?

19:43.280 --> 19:44.520
Yes.

19:46.400 --> 19:49.680
Chengcheng takes after me.
She has a good appetite.

19:50.640 --> 19:52.760
She can eat anything with gusto.

19:55.960 --> 19:59.480
So, Granny, do you know
what kind of boy Chengcheng likes?

20:07.440 --> 20:08.640
Chengcheng?

20:09.240 --> 20:11.200
Chengcheng likes

20:12.480 --> 20:15.760
smart, serious,

20:16.920 --> 20:18.920
and responsible ones.

20:19.520 --> 20:21.440
Isn't that just Senior Tang?

20:21.520 --> 20:22.840
Senior Tang, good luck.

20:22.920 --> 20:25.200
I hope you win Chengcheng's heart soon.

20:27.080 --> 20:27.960
Thank you.

20:28.960 --> 20:30.000
I've already won it.

20:31.320 --> 20:34.080
Then, you have to drink this.

20:34.160 --> 20:35.000
Congratulations.

20:36.920 --> 20:37.960
No.

20:39.040 --> 20:42.120
I'll drink it for him.

20:42.200 --> 20:44.320
He has to drive later.

20:45.400 --> 20:46.240
Here you go.

20:56.400 --> 20:58.040
Granny, you can really drink.

21:02.760 --> 21:04.720
I've never had it before,
so I want to try it.

21:06.320 --> 21:07.840
Let's eat.

21:16.240 --> 21:17.080
UPGRADING

21:19.320 --> 21:21.480
The filter is upgrading so fast this time.

21:22.280 --> 21:24.800
At this rate,
it'll be finished by tomorrow morning,

21:24.880 --> 21:25.920
and I won't have to ask for leave.

21:27.440 --> 21:29.560
Where are you staying tonight?

21:30.160 --> 21:31.160
I'm going to Lin Yuan's house.

21:35.920 --> 21:39.720
It's closer to my place.
Lin Yuan's house isn't on the way.

21:44.600 --> 21:46.560
Are you saying

21:47.080 --> 21:48.640
I should go to your place?

21:51.480 --> 21:53.240
When the filter had problems before,

21:53.920 --> 21:55.640
you always hid at Lin Yuan's house.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.440
Now,

21:58.160 --> 22:00.040
I can be your shelter too.

22:06.400 --> 22:10.040
Sure. I've stayed at your place before.

22:16.400 --> 22:17.480
You're awake?

22:18.200 --> 22:19.480
Good morning.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.320
Come in.

22:21.400 --> 22:24.000
From today, this is your new home.

22:32.640 --> 22:34.080
You've stayed there before,

22:34.640 --> 22:36.120
but it's Su Chengcheng's first time

22:36.800 --> 22:38.320
to stay at my place.

22:55.480 --> 22:58.320
Yuan, take this with you when you leave.

22:59.600 --> 23:02.560
- Yuan, have some fruit.
- Thank you, Uncle.

23:02.640 --> 23:06.400
Qingli and Chengcheng are never home.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.040
They're always busy.

23:08.120 --> 23:10.720
Luckily, Yuan
can often spend time with us.

23:10.800 --> 23:13.480
Otherwise, who would eat
all the delicious food I make?

23:13.560 --> 23:16.680
- Exactly.
- I love the dishes you cook, Uncle.

23:16.760 --> 23:17.960
I'll always make them for you.

23:20.040 --> 23:20.960
Yuan,

23:21.480 --> 23:23.960
I just heard someone call you.

23:24.040 --> 23:26.880
It sounded like a boy,
and he called you Yuan.

23:26.960 --> 23:27.920
Who is he?

23:30.720 --> 23:31.640
Gu Yu.

23:32.360 --> 23:34.840
- Gu Yu?
- Gu Yu.

23:36.520 --> 23:38.240
Here, have some melon.

23:40.920 --> 23:42.040
Are you dating?

23:45.880 --> 23:47.280
Have a strawberry.

23:49.200 --> 23:50.280
How old is he?

23:50.360 --> 23:51.720
Where does he work?

23:56.680 --> 23:59.360
Where does he work? Why can't you tell us?

23:59.440 --> 24:00.520
Wait.

24:01.040 --> 24:02.800
Dad, I'm staying
at Lin Yuan's place tonight,

24:02.880 --> 24:03.960
so I won't be going back.

24:05.840 --> 24:07.680
It's Chengcheng.

24:07.760 --> 24:10.440
She said she's staying
at Yuan's place tonight.

24:12.520 --> 24:13.880
Staying at your place?

24:16.680 --> 24:17.960
Yeah. We agreed.

24:18.040 --> 24:19.720
I'll go back after finishing the fruit.

24:30.400 --> 24:32.080
I'm staying at Tang Qi's place tonight.

24:32.160 --> 24:34.000
Stick to the same story
when you tell my parents.

24:40.800 --> 24:42.760
Chengcheng's boss.

24:43.440 --> 24:45.080
- Tang Qi.
- Tang Qi.

24:46.120 --> 24:47.600
What's up with Tang Qi?

24:49.880 --> 24:52.480
Chengcheng is staying
at Tang Qi's place tonight.

24:56.000 --> 24:57.200
What?

24:58.480 --> 25:01.360
Yuan, ask her about it.
What's really going on?

25:02.040 --> 25:05.240
Uncle, Aunt, I don't think I should ask.

25:14.760 --> 25:15.720
I'll ask then.

25:20.080 --> 25:22.400
What's going on between you and Tang Qi?

25:31.840 --> 25:34.840
Since when have you been close enough
for you to stay together at night?

25:47.120 --> 25:48.960
We're dating.

25:49.040 --> 25:51.120
Don't jump to conclusions.
We have separate rooms.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.120
We sleep in different beds.

25:52.200 --> 25:53.600
I'll explain the details later.

25:53.680 --> 25:55.040
Just keep it a secret for now.

26:03.480 --> 26:07.040
Su, according to Chengcheng,

26:08.000 --> 26:09.640
she and Tang Qi are dating, right?

26:12.120 --> 26:16.360
It's very clear from what she wrote.
She said, "We're dating."

26:16.440 --> 26:19.680
So, it must be true.

26:20.600 --> 26:23.680
They're smart enough
to live in separate rooms.

26:24.320 --> 26:27.200
Qingli, isn't Tang Qi your classmate?

26:27.280 --> 26:28.200
He's not bad looking.

26:28.840 --> 26:30.120
What's his personality like?

26:30.200 --> 26:34.440
He's just a normal man.
He has flaws and strengths.

26:35.120 --> 26:37.080
That doesn't tell us anything.

26:38.480 --> 26:39.880
Yuan, you're the best.

26:39.960 --> 26:42.040
Send Chengcheng a message

26:42.120 --> 26:44.920
and ask her
when she can bring Tang Qi back

26:45.000 --> 26:46.320
so we can meet him.

26:46.400 --> 26:47.960
Right, ask her.

26:48.040 --> 26:49.240
She…

26:49.320 --> 26:51.480
Chengcheng asked me to keep this from you.

26:51.560 --> 26:52.760
What's there to hide?

26:52.840 --> 26:54.200
- We're her parents.
- Yeah.

26:54.280 --> 26:55.560
- We'll know sooner or later…
- Alright, Dad, Mom.

26:55.640 --> 26:57.040
Don't rush.

26:57.120 --> 26:58.960
This is just the beginning.

26:59.040 --> 27:02.800
Even if they're dating,
their relationship is still unstable.

27:04.520 --> 27:05.360
True.

27:05.880 --> 27:07.880
Su, don't be impatient.

27:07.960 --> 27:10.440
The young couple needs some space.

27:10.520 --> 27:11.920
Right, let's give them space.

27:12.440 --> 27:15.040
Here's what I'll do.
I'll reply to Chengcheng,

27:15.120 --> 27:17.160
acting like I don't know anything.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.800
Chengcheng, no worries.

27:21.880 --> 27:23.720
Just rest at Yuan's place.

27:23.800 --> 27:24.920
No need to rush back.

27:29.200 --> 27:33.920
Just so we're clear,
we'll all act like we don't know anything,

27:34.520 --> 27:35.920
and we all must stick to the same story.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.640
Qingli.

27:43.160 --> 27:46.120
Just consider this as a cosplay,
and be the double agent.

28:03.480 --> 28:04.320
Stamped.

28:16.000 --> 28:19.040
Just rest at Yuan's place.
No need to rush back.

28:23.520 --> 28:25.960
I'm not in a hurry to go home.

28:37.400 --> 28:38.240
Come in.

29:03.840 --> 29:07.400
I've warmed up some milk for you.
It helps with sleep.

29:08.080 --> 29:09.960
Thanks. Just leave it there.

29:14.920 --> 29:15.920
Get some rest.

30:12.600 --> 30:13.960
When did you draw that?

30:18.960 --> 30:20.720
When I realized I liked you.

30:21.240 --> 30:24.560
I found out I didn't have any photos
of you on my phone,

30:25.080 --> 30:26.120
so I drew it myself.

30:33.560 --> 30:35.640
I really like the fair costume.

30:35.720 --> 30:38.840
But I was so busy that day
that I didn't have time to take a picture.

30:39.480 --> 30:40.600
Thank you.

30:44.720 --> 30:48.120
In the future,
I can draw pictures of us together.

30:57.200 --> 30:58.640
EXCITED

31:30.760 --> 31:33.400
Su Chengcheng's parents
made these for you?

31:34.440 --> 31:35.800
I can't cook.

31:35.880 --> 31:36.920
Though I have a nanny,

31:37.000 --> 31:38.800
they're always worried
that I won't eat well,

31:38.880 --> 31:40.920
so they ask me to come eat every few days.

31:41.000 --> 31:43.960
They also make wonton,
meatballs, and fish cakes

31:44.040 --> 31:45.120
and ask me to keep them in my fridge.

31:45.200 --> 31:47.440
Whenever I want to eat,
I can just heat it up.

31:48.400 --> 31:50.240
They treat you like their daughter.

31:53.920 --> 31:57.800
Do you mind,
or are you afraid to meet the parents?

32:04.760 --> 32:07.520
If you don't want to meet them,
then we won't.

32:08.040 --> 32:10.240
The one dating you is me, not my mom.

32:10.320 --> 32:12.360
You don't need to worry about the elders.

32:22.760 --> 32:24.120
Are you saying

32:25.240 --> 32:26.600
you want me to meet your parents?

32:29.240 --> 32:31.960
My uncle and aunt
treat me like their third daughter.

32:32.040 --> 32:34.880
They always think
I don't have the brains of Qingli

32:34.960 --> 32:36.680
or the strength of Chengcheng,

32:36.760 --> 32:37.640
so they worry I'll get hurt.

32:37.720 --> 32:39.560
They probably want to meet you
to feel at ease.

32:41.480 --> 32:42.640
Got it.

32:44.760 --> 32:47.280
I'm not afraid to meet your parents, but…

32:48.000 --> 32:49.240
When will it be?

32:49.320 --> 32:52.200
Should I prepare something?

32:53.760 --> 32:55.600
I heard Uncle is a great cook.

32:55.680 --> 32:58.280
Maybe I should sign up
for a cooking class.

33:00.400 --> 33:02.080
Are you nervous?

33:02.960 --> 33:03.960
A little.

33:06.200 --> 33:07.040
Don't worry.

33:07.120 --> 33:10.080
With Chengcheng taking the heat,
we're fine for now.

33:10.160 --> 33:11.840
What did Su Chengcheng do again?

34:17.040 --> 34:18.920
Finally, I won't need
to take time off anymore.

34:27.040 --> 34:27.920
UPGRADED

34:28.000 --> 34:28.840
NEW

34:28.920 --> 34:31.040
Let me check out the new features.

34:31.120 --> 34:32.199
NEW

34:32.280 --> 34:34.760
INNER MONOLOGUE, NEW

34:36.480 --> 34:38.800
Inner Monologue?

34:39.360 --> 34:40.639
What does that mean?

34:41.159 --> 34:43.199
INNER MONOLOGUE, NEW

34:58.800 --> 35:01.120
It doesn't seem useful.

35:31.040 --> 35:32.720
Tang Qi is so good-looking.

35:36.120 --> 35:37.840
TANG QI IS SO GOOD-LOOKING.

35:44.800 --> 35:47.040
Why is he staring at me?

35:47.120 --> 35:49.440
Does he want to hug me?

35:54.040 --> 35:55.840
The filter has been upgraded.

35:55.920 --> 35:58.960
There's a new feature
called Inner Monologue.

35:59.040 --> 36:01.560
I've tried it, but nothing has happened.

36:08.920 --> 36:10.480
He does want to hug me.

36:18.560 --> 36:21.600
Next, is he going to give me
a good morning kiss?

36:21.680 --> 36:25.000
NEXT, IS HE GOING TO GIVE ME
A GOOD MORNING KISS?

36:27.360 --> 36:28.800
Good morning.

36:35.520 --> 36:36.480
Good morning.

36:43.040 --> 36:45.240
So clingy in the morning.

36:45.320 --> 36:47.360
I didn't expect this side of you, Tang Qi.

36:49.160 --> 36:52.360
Such a warm hug. I like it.

36:56.640 --> 36:58.160
Your face is fine now.

36:58.240 --> 37:02.160
I'm happy for you,
so I had to give you a hug.

37:07.360 --> 37:09.360
Did you make all that?

37:09.440 --> 37:11.000
It looks pretty delicious.

37:11.760 --> 37:12.600
Try it.

37:36.880 --> 37:41.280
Tang Qi is feeding me.
Should I feed him too?

37:45.440 --> 37:46.280
What's wrong?

37:47.760 --> 37:49.400
Aren't you feeding me?

37:51.960 --> 37:53.440
Are you serious?

37:56.600 --> 37:58.000
It's all about reciprocity.

38:00.160 --> 38:03.560
Tang Qi is so adorable. So cute.

38:09.480 --> 38:10.840
It tastes better when you fight over it.

38:15.800 --> 38:18.680
Then, should I also fight over it?

38:29.520 --> 38:30.840
He's going to kiss me.

38:30.920 --> 38:32.720
My first kiss.

39:10.880 --> 39:11.840
This…

39:12.760 --> 39:14.360
This is it?

39:20.720 --> 39:21.720
You want to kiss?

39:23.200 --> 39:24.240
Yes.

39:25.680 --> 39:28.400
No, I don't want it anymore.

39:28.480 --> 39:30.000
Of course not.

39:30.080 --> 39:31.440
YES

39:35.320 --> 39:38.120
This is what it feels like
to kiss on the forehead.

39:38.200 --> 39:40.040
It actually feels so sweet.

39:40.720 --> 39:44.920
I wonder what a passionate kiss
feels like.

40:04.200 --> 40:05.080
Do you want

40:06.600 --> 40:07.840
to try it?

40:11.560 --> 40:13.000
Try what?

40:18.320 --> 40:19.880
A passionate kiss.

40:23.320 --> 40:25.560
How does he know what I'm thinking?

40:27.680 --> 40:29.840
HOW DOES HE KNOW WHAT I'M THINKING?

40:36.920 --> 40:38.680
I can see your inner voice.

40:44.600 --> 40:45.840
Where?

40:47.240 --> 40:49.040
Why can't I see it?

40:49.120 --> 40:50.520
It's above your head.

40:53.920 --> 40:55.920
It went back with your head.

41:08.840 --> 41:10.560
There really is a monologue.

41:10.640 --> 41:12.520
This is some next-level tech.

41:12.600 --> 41:15.000
The filter can read my thoughts.

41:16.160 --> 41:17.760
It's theoretically possible.

41:17.840 --> 41:20.200
Smart pillows can capture your brainwaves

41:20.280 --> 41:24.760
and convert the images, sounds, and text
in your dreams into data for collection.

41:24.840 --> 41:27.600
The filter's inner monologue
must be similar.

41:27.680 --> 41:32.000
It's learned all about you
through your long-term use.

41:32.640 --> 41:33.480
Let me try it.

41:36.880 --> 41:38.880
INNER MONOLOGUE

41:40.720 --> 41:41.680
INNER MONOLOGUE

41:44.560 --> 41:45.680
AVAILABLE TO TANG QI

41:50.880 --> 41:51.880
What about now?

41:51.960 --> 41:54.720
I can't see it. Can you?

41:56.280 --> 41:59.240
I must be playing the lead role.

41:59.320 --> 42:02.640
Otherwise, how would the filter choose me?

42:02.720 --> 42:04.200
I can see it.

42:09.680 --> 42:13.760
AVAILABLE TO ALL, AVAILABLE
TO SU CHENGCHENG, AVAILABLE TO TANG QI

42:16.560 --> 42:18.800
This is so fun.

42:18.880 --> 42:22.200
If I want to whisper something,
I can secretly tell Tang Qi anytime.

42:25.160 --> 42:27.040
What do you want to tell me secretly?

42:30.240 --> 42:31.840
I can't tell you right now.

42:36.320 --> 42:37.400
But…

42:40.160 --> 42:42.320
I have a lot of things
to tell you secretly.

42:43.040 --> 42:44.320
What are they?

42:53.520 --> 42:54.600
I love you.

43:20.280 --> 43:21.400
Did you know?

43:21.920 --> 43:26.280
Every time I saw you before,
my heartbeat was always like this.

43:28.880 --> 43:29.960
Me too.

43:36.080 --> 43:37.080
Every time.

43:40.200 --> 43:41.800
No matter what you become,

43:48.840 --> 43:51.280
my heart will speed up because of you,

43:54.880 --> 43:56.680
telling me over and over

43:59.280 --> 44:00.680
that it likes you.

44:10.560 --> 44:13.400
You… Aren't you curious

44:15.520 --> 44:18.000
about what a passionate kiss feels like?

44:21.120 --> 44:22.800
I…

44:29.080 --> 44:30.320
I also want to know.

44:57.720 --> 44:58.800
There's one more thing.

45:01.520 --> 45:02.360
I…

45:04.280 --> 45:05.480
It's also my first kiss.

45:10.320 --> 45:11.640
Please bear with me.
